 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of downtown Greenwich, CT living in this beautifully renovated, one level apartment featuring 2 bedrooms and 1 bath. The inviting open floor plan seamlessly connects the groumet kitchen with the spacious living and dining areas, ideal for everyday living and entertaining. Eastern exposure fills the home with morning light, while a privte balcony offers an outdoor retreat. Additional features include hardwood floors, custom cabinetry, a generously sized primary bedroom with a walk-in closet and a beautifully appointed bath with wlk-in shower. Putnam Hill Apartments are convenient to Greenwich Avenue stores & restaurants, hospital, MetroNorth, library and Whole Foods. Garage parking as available @ $85 per month. Pet Restrictions - one dog or one cat, up to 24 lbs max and shoulder height up to 18\" high. Buyer pays a one-time capital assessment of .5% of the sale price at closing. Monthly charges include heat, hot water & taxes. This fantastic property is turn-key and ready to move in!",
